# Review profile: evaluates what a cheap-profile run already produced. reviewer-tests
# (src/ai-agents/reviewer-tests.ts) never writes code — it reads the generated file plus the
# framework's conventions and returns a VERDICT/REASON verdict via the claude CLI, --permission-mode
# plan (read-only, no edits possible).
#
# The whole point of this profile: review runs on the SAME provider (Claude) but at HIGHER effort
# than generation — cheap.env's AI_AGENTS_CLAUDE_EFFORT=medium generates, this reviews at "high".
# A pass reviewing itself at the same effort level defeats the purpose of a paranoid pass.
#
# Source before running the review step, e.g.: set -a; source ai-agents/profiles/paranoid.env; set +a

AI_REVIEW_CLAUDE_TIER=sonnet
AI_REVIEW_CLAUDE_EFFORT=high
